@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:CommitReachabilityEvidence a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Commit Reachability Evidence"; skos:definition "Evidence that an exact commit exists and is retrievable from the publication authority." .